    "updated_at": "2017-11-15T12:07:56Z",
    "body": "This is technically an issue with whatwg/html, but we can discuss it here. I don't care strongly.\r\n\r\nIf this also needs to work for cross-origin `Location` objects it would be simplest to change step 1 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#crossorigingetownpropertyhelper-(-o,-p-) and step 3 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#crossoriginownpropertykeys-(-o-): add \"`then`\" to the list of those three symbols.\r\n\r\ncc @bzbarsky @cdumez @domenic ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
