    "updated_at": "2017-11-15T15:19:30Z",
    "body": "We probably _could_ do that.  @bholley may have opinions on whether it's OK from his pov security-wise.\r\n\r\nI just double-checked the interaction with subframes named \"then\", and I think it should be ok, since at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#windowproxy-getownproperty step 5 the value would be undefined, then at step 6 we would find the named subframe, but it's not callable, so would not affect the Promise behavior.",
