    "updated_at": "2017-11-17T13:49:47Z",
    "body": "Oops, maybe I'm wrong.  We'd like to intentionally shadow `then` even though it would break the backward compatibility, right?  Just in case, I'd like to confirm it before implementing.  Is it okay?",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
