    "created_at": "2017-11-17T13:53:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-17T13:53:03Z",
    "body": "I'm not sure if that's what we want. It's easy enough to move step 1 of CrossOriginGetOwnPropertyHelper down and it would be more consistent with how a same-origin window behaves.\r\n\r\nThe potential for conflict would also complicate CrossOriginOwnPropertyKeys somewhat as we don't want to return duplicate keys there. We'd only want to append \"then\" if it's not there already.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
